"Fn works alone or with Shift, Control, Option or Command, pressed before or after Fn. While Fn is held, adding a modifier switches the recording to that shortcut; releasing one does not. Fn with letter keys is not available because macOS reserves those 🌐 shortcuts." = "Fn funciona solo o con Mayúsculas, Control, Opción o Comando, pulsados antes o después de Fn. Mientras mantienes Fn, pulsar un modificador cambia la grabación a ese atajo; soltarlo no. Fn con letras no está disponible porque macOS reserva esos atajos 🌐.";
"Restore default shortcuts" = "Restaurar atajos predeterminados";
